{"date":"2009-04-09","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/05/c0/41189_HVAi6.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/05/c0/41189_HVAi6.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/05/c0/41189_HVAi6.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/05/c0/41189_HVAi6.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/05/c0/41189_HVAi6.jpg"},"summary":"1976年，9岁的玛丽·黛西·丁格尔是澳大利亚墨尔本的一个小女孩，喜欢动画片“诺布利特”、甜炼乳和巧克力。玛丽的妈妈是个酒鬼，而在茶叶包装厂工作的父亲平日只喜欢制作鸟标本。孤独的玛丽没有朋友，某一天心血来潮给美国纽约市的马克思·杰瑞·霍罗威茨写了一封信询问美国小孩从哪里来，并附上一根樱桃巧克力棒。44岁的马克思患有自闭症及肥胖，碰巧也喜欢看“诺布利特”动画片及吃巧克力。二人的笔友关系从1976年维持到1994年，期间各自经历了许多人生起伏，直到成年的玛丽终于来到纽约看望马克思……","name":"Mary and Max","name_cn":"玛丽和马克思","tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":200,"total_count":86832},{"name":"剧场版","count":191,"total_count":725254},{"name":"2009","count":138,"total_count":39356},{"name":"定格动画","count":131,"total_count":3228},{"name":"粘土","count":130,"total_count":208},{"name":"治愈","count":96,"total_count":302149},{"name":"澳大利亚","count":96,"total_count":188},{"name":"友情","count":92,"total_count":6520},{"name":"动画电影","count":86,"total_count":43858},{"name":"原创","count":58,"total_count":620816},{"name":"电影","count":41,"total_count":13584},{"name":"AdamElliot","count":25,"total_count":30},{"name":"STOP-MOTION","count":17,"total_count":17},{"name":"ANIMETHEMOVIE","count":8,"total_count":237},{"name":"2009年","count":6,"total_count":2028},{"name":"致郁","count":5,"total_count":23494},{"name":"2000s","count":4,"total_count":3087},{"name":"动画","count":3,"total_count":35737},{"name":"定格","count":3,"total_count":148},{"name":"补旧番","count":3,"total_count":5337},{"name":"2000-2009","count":2,"total_count":1239},{"name":"想补的旧番","count":2,"total_count":245},{"name":"00","count":2,"total_count":470},{"name":"杂","count":2,"total_count":264},{"name":"Adam_Elliot","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"真实","count":1,"total_count":255},{"name":"映画","count":1,"total_count":6306},{"name":"虐心","count":1,"total_count":527},{"name":"劇場版","count":